{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KHkKbLbUWo4jBR9Wz5tBFG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All required reading is already provided in the project context. Let me review the key patterns and requirements:\n\n**From cmd/cat/main.go** - patterns to follow:\n- Manual flag parsing over `os.Args[1:]`\n- SIGPIPE handling via goroutine with `signal.Notify`\n- Error formatting: `fmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"sponge: %s\\n\", err)`\n- Exit codes via `os.Exit()`\n\n**From prd007-sponge** - key requirements:\n- R1: Soak stdin completely before opening output file, 8192-byte initial buffer doubling on overflow\n- R1.3: Spill to temp file when exceeding memory threshold\n- R1.4: Temp file in TMPDIR or /tmp, pattern \"sponge.XXXXXX\"\n- R1.5: Cleanup handler for SIGINT/SIGTERM/SIGHUP/SIGPIPE\n- R2: Atomic rename, cross-device fallback, mode preservation via lstat\n- R3: Append mode (-a)\n- R4: Passthrough mode (no filename)\n- R5: Exit codes and error handling\n\nLet me check what Go module is set up so I know the import paths."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":443,"cache_read_input_tokens":104826,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":443},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4436eefb-e1ea-49fc-984f-7fffcc0bc527","uuid":"9fef9565-d7c0-467a-baf8-34a47750d31b"}
